@startuml task_activity
skinparam dpi 300
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Helvetica"
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam activityFontSize 13
skinparam arrowFontSize 12
skinparam roundCorner 8

start

:Student creates or selects Task;
note right: Initial Status: **Planned**

:Student begins technical work;
note right: Status transitions to: **In Progress**

:Student submits completion proof\n(PR number, commit hash, description);
note right: Status transitions to: **Verification Pending**

:Heuristic Engine scores evidence\n(Deterministic confidence: 0.20 - 0.98);

:Teacher inspects evidence & score;

if (Teacher decision?) then (Approve)
  :Status transitions to: **Completed**;
  :System awards XP to student;
  :System logs idempotent contribution entry;
  :Project progress percentage updates;
  stop
else (Reject)
  :Teacher attaches revision feedback;
  :Status returns to: **In Progress**;
  :Student revises code and resubmits;
  stop
endif

@enduml
